# 🛡️ Global Risk Prediction Manifest (Blacklist Version)

# 1. Block massive dataset types globally
**/*.csv
**/*.parquet
**/*.zip
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite

# 2. Block serialized ML weights & binary artifacts
**/*.pkl
**/*.h5
**/*.joblib

# 3. Block specific heavy-usage directories
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/moneyviz_surrogate/

# 4. Explicit project data isolation (Ignore these entire folders)
lending_club/data/
lending_club/outputs/
lending_club/models/

universal_historian/data/
universal_historian/models/
universal_historian/outputs/

# 5. Allow all other script and documentation files
!**/*.py
!**/*.md
!.gitignore
